      {
        "name": "places/ChIJxwVKIewABDQRjE3tHXAnTAY/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNmeGFiWWRnEAE",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 年前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "Please note that the pull is charged by half-hour, not by the hour. They even charged me per minute, which is ridiculous. They sneakily write the half-hour charge in very tiny text, and the service is terrible. They even asked me to pour my own water at the bar because they were busy.\n\n請注意，收費是按半小時計算，而不是按小時計算。他們甚至按分鐘來收費，實在太荒謬了。他們將半小時收費用非常細小的字寫出來，實在太狡猾了。而且服務非常差，他們竟然因為忙叫我自己去吧台倒水。",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
